{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 43","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the price of an article is increased by percent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, then the decrease in percent of sales must not exceed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in order to yield the same income. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0eff68b515ca32946f5dfe592c4fe606da42c979.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{1+p} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{1-p} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{p}{1+p} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{p}{p-1}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{1-p}{1+p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"524\" height=\"40\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It turns out that none of the listed solutions are the true solution for the problem as written, so we'll edit it slightly by replacing \"percent\" with \"proportion\". To solve the modified problem, note that the price of the article is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/e/dde4993a0a4288d18f575e8d8caf345889648340.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" /> times what it was originally, so that demand must be at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/7/7777cd74391405fc28a965658aa45bf62296dfb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1+p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"46\" height=\"42\" /> times what it was originally to yield at least the same income. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/1/4b1a84cb3199da905759258b583eedd441d4b8da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-d = \\frac{1}{1+p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"107\" height=\"40\" />, this implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bba6f13885eeabb23ce3dfe11f2fd8bee155bbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = \\frac{p}{1+p}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"76\" height=\"36\" />. Thusly, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/d/10d8680e45177742ecdcf12245a1a250fd1513a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"38\" height=\"30\" />, and we are done.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 42\">Problem 42</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 44\">Problem 44</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1953 AHSME Proble